=== Episode 3: Bread ===
In bread week, the bakers firstly had to make 12 [[rye bread]] [[Bread roll|rolls]] in {{frac|3|1|2|}} hours. In the technical challenge, they were given 3 hours to make 4 [[ciabatta]] loaves using Paul Hollywood's recipe with the advice from Paul that they should be patient. In the showstopper, the bakers were required to make a bread centrepiece in 4 hours. The centrepiece should be a filled-loaf that is spectacular and tasty, and would be judged on its appearance, design and crust, and should be well-baked on the inside.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
