=== Episode 6: European Cakes ===
For the signature bake, the challenge was to bake a European-inspired cake, but it had to be [[leavened]] with yeast. The bakers were given 3 hours for the challenge. The technical challenge was set using one of Mary Berry's recipes for a Swedish Princess cake, ''[[Princess cake|Prinsesstårta]]''. The recipe is the most complicated yet, requiring 26 separate ingredients with 14 stages, and to be completed in 2<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>4</sub> hours. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were required to make a contemporary version of the Hungarian [[Dobos torte|Dobos Torte]] in 5 hours. The cake should have at least two tiers, with particular emphasis on caramel sugar work on the cake.

