=== Episode 10: Final ===
In the final signature challenge, the bakers had to make [[Viennoiserie]] in 3<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>2</sub> hours. They had to make 2 different types of the pastry. In the final technical, the judges decided to bring things "back to basics" by asking the bakers to bake 12 [[Victoria Sandwich]]es, [[Tarte au Citron|Tartes au Citron]] and [[Scone]]s. The challenge, however, was that they had only 2 hours to make this with only 3 instructions. The final showstopper was a [[Pièce montée|Pièce Montée]]. The bakers were given 5 hours to make this, and the judges said it must be in some self-standing structure.
